WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.180
What is the point of life?

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.340
I don't think there's one instruction

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.020
hidden inside the universe,

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.860
waiting for us to find it.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.160
But that doesn't make life pointless.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.800
It makes purpose something we can practice.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.160
Pay attention.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.880
Care for what can be hurt.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.760
Make something; learn something;

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.960
let yourself enjoy being here.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:28.300
You don't have to earn your place

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.340
by being useful.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.020
Rest and friendship count, too.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.920
Nothing we do lasts forever.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.480
But a shelter doesn't have to last forever

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.000
to keep someone warm tonight.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.320
We can't mend the whole world.

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.600
We can leave one corner

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.280
more alive than we found it.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.700
For me, that's a point of life:

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.460
not to complete the circle,

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.587
but to leave more room for life.
